  "details": "When running VRChat in VR mode, it is possible to improve performance by taking the desktop window and making it as small as possible.\nIt would be nice to have an option in-game that would simply disable rendering output to this window instead.  Additionally, it would enhance privacy by not showing what is on screen in the window in the case it is shown, rather than relying on remembering to minimize the window.",
